# Read by scripts/prepare-data.sh (scripts/prepare-data.sh machine, and its
# default run) and scripts/check-noir.sh: the machine's own test circuits,
# compiled into DATA_DIR for the machine's suites (sidecar-core, sidecar-tip,
# sidecar-node, sidecar-oblivious and sidecar-orchestrator).
# EMBEDDED names the machine's own circuits, the registration circuit and the
# audit circuit: scripts/prepare-data.sh compiles them into DATA_DIR/circuits
# like the rest, and sidecar-core's build script embeds those two artifacts in
# the crate (machine/sidecar-core/build.rs). They are not round circuits, so
# scripts/check-noir.sh does not execute them; it runs their Noir tests (the
# registration circuit's known answers among them).
# Six test circuits' manifests are in manifests/<circuit>.json, which the
# tests read (sidecar-test-fixtures `machine_manifest`, include_str! in
# sidecar-core and sidecar-tip) and scripts/check-manifests.py checks;
# tip_counter_shared's and amm_swap_tip_priced's are built in their tests
# (sidecar-orchestrator tests/shared_receipt.rs and tests/node_held.rs). The oblivious tree
# has no machine test round: real oblivious rounds run as lending-tip's
# `*_oblivious` rounds (sidecar-orchestrator's tests/lending_oblivious.rs).
#
# The queued (tip) test rounds are a counter written for the machine's tests
# (chain-held; node-held under secret-shared receipt intake in tip_counter_shared),
# not the amm-tip example: the counter takes pss_core's tip helpers (the
# request id, the slot commitment, the store), so its public inputs follow the
# contract library's layout that REGISTER checks, but no example's library, so
# the machine's lifecycle tests stay independent of the examples and test only
# the machine (the machine-owned record path, the step 4 hook). The one
# exception is amm_swap_tip_priced, the amm-tip swap with its min_out a pinned
# read, for the orchestrator's node-held test of the example's rounds: a
# pinned value is public and an app input is not, so that variant needs a
# circuit of its own.
CIRCUITS="tip_counter_init tip_counter tip_counter_priced tip_counter_epoch tip_counter_shared tip_tree_init tip_tree amm_swap_tip_priced"
EMBEDDED="sidecar_register sidecar_audit"
LIBS=""
# The total test rounds, linted: the queued rounds with an Outcome and no
# assert (the tree and the secret-shared counter).
TOTAL_CIRCUITS="tip_counter_shared tip_tree"
